 "<b style=\"font-size:25px;color:#8a5bd0\">Cuaderno</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#0f2b3d\">Para anotar lo que veas.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:25px;color:#8a5bd0\">Notebook</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#0f2b3d\">To write down what you see.</span>",
 "Refrescad las normas antes de salir. Que cada persona diga una con sus palabras.": "Refresh the rules before leaving. Have each person state one in their own words.",
 "Normas del grupo": "Group rules",
 "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#1f78b4\">Juntos</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#0f2b3d\">Nadie se separa del grupo.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#1f78b4\">Together</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#0f2b3d\">Nobody leaves the group.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#c27031\">Escuchamos</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#0f2b3d\">A los guías y a los adultos.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#c27031\">We listen</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#0f2b3d\">To the guides and the adults.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#269189\">Cuidamos</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#0f2b3d\">El entorno y lo que encontramos.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:27px;color:#269189\">We take care</b><br><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#0f2b3d\">Of the environment and what we find.</span>",
