 "Insistid en que no es una obligación y en que cada persona puede elegir por intereses, no por rendimiento.": "Stress that it isn't mandatory and that each person can choose by interest, not by performance.",
 "Por qué participar": "Why take part",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#c93a6b\">Aprender de otra manera</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#2b1620\">Con juegos, proyectos y práctica.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#c93a6b\">Learn in a different way</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#2b1620\">With games, projects, and practice.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#2f8f9b\">Conocer a gente</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#2b1620\">De otros cursos y grupos.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#2f8f9b\">Meet people</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#2b1620\">From other grades and groups.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#b58227\">Descubrir talentos</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#2b1620\">Algo que quizá no sabías hacer.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#b58227\">Discover talents</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#2b1620\">Something you maybe didn't know you could do.</span>",
